# Model/checkpoint directories
**/checkpoints/*
**/models/*
**/weights/*
**/pretrained/*
**/runs/*

# Keep directory placeholders/documentation
!**/checkpoints/.gitkeep
!**/models/.gitkeep

# ============================================================
# Datasets / generated media
# ============================================================

# Ignore actual datasets
**/data/raw/*
**/data/processed/*
**/datasets/*
**/data/*
**/media/*
**/uploads/*
**/outputs/*
**/artifacts/*

# Keep README/.gitkeep files
!**/data/.gitkeep
!**/data/README.md
!**/data/**/README.md

